<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria places 1.04 bln levs 7-day T-bills.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria places 1.04 bln levs 7-day T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry placed 1.04 billion lev worth of seven-day discount T-bills, yielding 3.67 percent to maturity, the Bulgarian National Bank (BNB) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>In line with its usual practice the BNB did not say with which financial instituion or institutions the issue was placed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Details of the issue follow. Price is in percent of par.</p>
<p> Issue number		   BG 3011397000</p>
<p> Par value			1.04 bln levs</p>
<p> Issue date		     January 15, 1997</p>
<p> Maturity date		  January 22, 1997</p>
<p> Selling price		  96.46 pct</p>
<p> Yield to maturity	    3.67 pct</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569</p>
